  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">EGY CMMS Training Prog.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">EGY CMMS utbildningsprogr</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Den egyptiska elektricitetsmyndigheten h&#xE5;ller p&#xE5; att implementera det datoriserade underh&#xE5;llssystemet Amplissima vid sina kraftanl&#xE4;gg- ningar. Projektet innefattar uppgradering av existerande mjukvaru- licenser samt utbildning av personal. Ett viktigt syfte &#xE4;r att den egyptiska parten sj&#xE4;lv skall kunna genomf&#xF6;ra utbildning av personalen.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Egyptian Electricity Authority is in the process of implementing the Computerised Maintenance Management System Amplissima at their power stations. The project includes upgrading of existing soft ware licences as well as training of the personnel. One important goal is that the Egyptian party should be able to continue training of staff.</narrative>
  </description>
